      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/id": "4b37ea0a-b170-512b-b110-412075d4a4cc",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-1 \\\\ x+2y+z &=0 \\\\ x+3y &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form. Select the resulting augmented matrix.",
